{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "e83633abcf3f5b343020fe799c24b77057ed2368619c1b24a07802dbaa8d602c", "ja": "ぷっぷかプリン★プリン", "zh": "嘟嘟布丁★布丁", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "008c1363d93ac9d9d3033c29c87588297ff739b60509bd9982684611c23e41df", "ja": "茜と麗花は、イベントで販売する限定スイー\nツのアイディア出しを頼まれる。幾つかの案\nが出る中、麗花が提案したのは、ふたりの顔\n型のプリン。担当者に絶賛され、茜は顔型を\n取るために連れていかれてしまう……。", "zh": "茜和丽花受托为活动上销售的限定甜点出谋划策。在提出了几个方案后，丽花建议制作两人脸型的布丁。这个提案受到负责人极力称赞，茜也因此被带去取脸模……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "90da274eaef68074f9bf5addf8ef1be584890c705510f62c9ccafbf36373ae0c", "ja": "（今日は、商業施設側の企画担当者さんと劇場で\n打ち合わせだ。会議室の準備をしておかないとな）", "zh": "（今天要和商业设施方面的企划负责人在剧场开会。得先把会议室准备好才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "29364a945a02b5b275239ec4a4d526ee638b569c8887ae68cdb826c971971c3d", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん……。\n大変だよ。事件発生だよ！！", "zh": "{$P$}……\n不得了啦。出大事了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "75ee1c637b61b46915b58d80382ea48586e028904acbfdc609fa755642eaa033", "ja": "茜ちゃんの……茜ちゃんのプリンが、\n冷蔵庫から、こつぜんと姿を消したんだよ！", "zh": "小茜的……小茜的布丁，突然从冰箱里消失了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "030d6cc11dfcf37f94426cfe7655ebe9144f25dafeca25a750081035f32a3392", "ja": "それは……いつもの事じゃないのか？", "zh": "那不是……经常发生的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "6a1c67b0ddb2d908eaa059228c6d182d1d327732672e304cc97e3205198a9818", "ja": "よくわかったね、\nさすが{$P$}ちゃん！", "zh": "很懂嘛，\n不愧是{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "effb4e1a85e5b41c6b2a4f8506e5289ae503e45ced4273330dd8764f1dc48d91", "ja": "でも違うの！　今日のプリンは特別なの！\n限定の、高級いちごプリンだったんだよ！？", "zh": "但不是那样啦！今天的布丁可是特别的！是限定版的高级草莓布丁哦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "85e81db4616215a86e4d3b6b6987519e39b6ca7d40afef4c5a46a8fd5e803fef", "ja": "ふんふんふ～ん♪　ぷ・ぷ・ぷ・プリ～ン♪\n今日のプリンは、いちご味～♪", "zh": "哼哼哼～♪ 布、布、布、布丁～♪\n今天的布丁，是草莓味～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "46d31b3249f86d5b52af82333c14f4ef7ea2bc273bb7c4e0931f8117760616a0", "ja": "あっ。茜ちゃんに{$P$}さん、\n縮めて、あかデューサーさん！　おはようございます！", "zh": "啊。小茜加上{$P$}先生，\n缩写一下，就是茜デューサー先生！早上好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "93c4cdd29a91d6d133a7ab086989ec712478246d4f37fb2cfe8c65ce01ca5cbe", "ja": "ああ、麗花。おはよう。", "zh": "啊，丽花。早上好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "e85f47b08a2e75ece21f0cc8518637cb4b1e9e40db398f900c3f4bb6dbc92a39", "ja": "れ、麗花ちゃん……\n今の歌は……まさか……！？", "zh": "丽、丽花……\n刚才那首歌……难道……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1010_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "ce9c3159ebb5f54787fc8b5f3430b53f5613509c0bf321cdd04f995a871a745c", "ja": "{$P$}、ここにいたんですね。\nお客様がいらっしゃいましたよ。", "zh": "{$P$}，原来你在这里啊。\n客人已经来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1012_tantousya", "source_sha256": "30449000fbcfb6f91d4189e9be585e98a32d896a0601cc3e9373f8aea05ab7fa", "ja": "どうも、お世話になっております！\n本日はよろしくお願いいたします。", "zh": "您好，一直以来承蒙关照！\n今天也请多多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1013_p", "source_sha256": "61245cc266b82ddd693ff0cbbf2602d70d7da9844b041dba59048e2056243802", "ja": "お待ちしてました、こちらこそよろしくお願いします！\n律子、ありがとうな。", "zh": "等你很久了，彼此彼此，请多关照！\n律子，谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1014_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1015_tantousya", "source_sha256": "ae546df1b6ac3843750b8f7554b8e27fc4aa2f0c1530f6e3e8106a5decd0864c", "ja": "……そこで、アンバサダーのおふたりには、\n限定スイーツを考えていただきたいと思いまして。", "zh": "……所以，想请两位大使构思一款限定甜点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1016_009rit", "source_sha256": "f06685146eb2268ec203ce517a8df7bc82a06ecdcb33feb9afde4289704e7ef2", "ja": "なるほど、アイドルが考えた限定スイーツですか。\nハロウィンですし、話題になりそうですね。", "zh": "原来如此，是偶像们构思的限定甜点啊。\n毕竟是万圣节，应该会成为话题吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "7b8529799f02f178c657504dd809b2517c6090c8e0f44bf76c5aa1938dc6a628", "ja": "ほほう、限定スイーツ！", "zh": "哦哦，限定甜点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1018_p", "source_sha256": "3756213ca10dc44c984e2d38daa0042c38070d83b95732994a1deb9cd45369d2", "ja": "茜、さっそく何か思いついたのか？", "zh": "茜，这么快就想到什么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "a5bd9dc9e3ab953a6e033e62b74c12a3fb3e30059aabc80b2a5c7c862ae10b88", "ja": "フッ……まあね！　茜ちゃんといえば、\n劇場イチのアイディアの持ち主だよ！", "zh": "呵……那当然！说到小茜，我可是剧场里最有点子的人哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "f3d410f562bf1cc89f00bf9013c17f832a3a2da2daf5072472e38ececeedcfc0", "ja": "ズバリ！　限定スイーツには、キュートな茜ちゃん人形\nマスコット付き『茜ちゃんプリン』なんてどうかニャ？", "zh": "没错！限定甜点就做成附带可爱的小茜人偶吉祥物的\n“小茜布丁”，怎么样喵？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "af8081cbd1992903dfca55cbe03701fea7b83447405f973f8e28787fb4dd3eb6", "ja": "お味はもちろん、ハロウィン限定のカボチャ味！\nプルプル震える茜ちゃんプリン、どう？", "zh": "味道当然是万圣节限定的南瓜味啦！\n还会带着Q弹颤动的小茜布丁，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1022_009rit", "source_sha256": "a6a69031a001efa837c2401f02a9df8bab8d7ca26cf67db78b91d282bcd0bd5f", "ja": "茜にしては、なかなか堅実ね。けど、カボチャ味は\n他でもやってるし、うちならではの要素を入れたいわ。", "zh": "对茜来说，这个方向倒是挺稳妥的。不过南瓜口味别的地方也有，我想加入一些我们自己独特的元素。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "ece9e08ff80725791476b0c5f0c0c24c3e103b87f3ab1de5bce16569121f3fce", "ja": "それなら、ゾンビ茜ちゃんやミイラ茜ちゃん、\nヴァンパイア茜ちゃんにすればいいんじゃない？", "zh": "那样的话，做成僵尸小茜、木乃伊小茜和吸血鬼小茜，不就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "3f4e7ba1c0212b585563843b5b1b7143bcbf3eabde1c3801d53573f453d7bd25", "ja": "う～ん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1025_p", "source_sha256": "a540f8196b5fefd25de1e0cde047664be2120fd72fd94a3896a8bd12b75ee677", "ja": "あれ。麗花的にはイマイチか？", "zh": "咦？丽花觉得不太满意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1026_048rei", "source_sha256": "8fec0b5f1614b7234003b932cc19b66369296acc67f26c2ac18547c2dac6c3d3", "ja": "イマイチじゃないんですけど、もうすこしで、何か\n思いつきそうな気が……。う～ん……あっ！", "zh": "不是不怎么样，只是感觉再差一点就能想起什么了……嗯——啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1027_048rei", "source_sha256": "af74df5001ca0d18af581bdebaccb09738df12a4e4f58bfb6d8e2ae096867345", "ja": "ひらめきました！　ハロウィン限定の茜ちゃんプリン、\n茜ちゃんの形にしたらどうでしょう？", "zh": "我想到啦！把万圣节限定的小茜布丁做成小茜的形状，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "5004502ac3a8a5877a44fd65e6ca25ca23099c2bc36ded114efa214db75de997", "ja": "茜の形……つまり、茜ちゃん人形の形って事か？", "zh": "茜的形状……也就是说，是小茜人偶的形状吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1029_048rei", "source_sha256": "7abdd1be4f2ad5e94076abbe43ee6bfcf922de7f002356b7e40365ddd2f4c912", "ja": "いいえ！　茜ちゃんの顔型を取って、\nその形のプリンにするんです♪", "zh": "不！　是取小茜的脸模，\n做成那种形状的布丁哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1030_048rei", "source_sha256": "9a6e7dba889d1ce4ff668e9d008d302225f9028c512e2a6ef317d7ce010974a0", "ja": "あ、もちろん私のプリンも作ってくださいね！　ふたつ\nそろって、『ぷっぷかプリンプリン』なんてなんて♪", "zh": "啊，当然也请做一个我的布丁！两个凑在一起，就叫“噗噗卡布丁布丁”什么的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1031_023aka", "source_sha256": "c5d2d7f63ce2a209c8ba46d0a29c79e1b78749c525acc1249cc9a10c8625895b", "ja": "顔型……？", "zh": "脸型……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1032_p", "source_sha256": "a71e04342f272adebe481e578db59cf610c2ecc97d769eeadef54619d0cc8fb5", "ja": "ぷっぷかプリンプリン……？", "zh": "噗噗卡布丁布丁……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1033_tantousya", "source_sha256": "2dd3fd3e405ed0e333d6c511b68b3992a93d9db1d717c6493e3d6c4a6db71907", "ja": "い……", "zh": "呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1034_tantousya", "source_sha256": "1bd2f02688c20f62e6a03f6be28ba023e33432990fb9b858b7c3ef25c88686a3", "ja": "いいですね！　そういう尖ったのが欲しかったんです！\nぜひ、それでいきましょう！！", "zh": "很好！我想要的就是这种有个性的方案！\n就用这个吧！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1035_023aka", "source_sha256": "f72d3637915c3c018a56e32c789d9a0335db190bc94041ab206f203781d655f1", "ja": "なんですと！？", "zh": "你说什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1036_023aka", "source_sha256": "235d2bb4d5a993e36680f56f38d6df54b53d6d75c2e7b41fe46458d6504dc439", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、いいの！？\n顔型とか不穏な単語が聞こえてきた気がしたけど！", "zh": "{$P$}，这样好吗！？\n我好像听到了脸型之类很不妙的词耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1037_p", "source_sha256": "8a3f7de6e25279260054868fc43ae700e1ed858c9a112ee6158af3aed6fffe91", "ja": "実際にスイーツを売るのは、お店だし……\n担当者さんが納得しているなら、異論はないよ。", "zh": "实际上负责卖甜点的是店家……\n既然负责人也接受了，那我没有异议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1038_009rit", "source_sha256": "e5acbc9f4b61aac5eeebdf95154f4e39d7034574563f4aa60902f2c896491a72", "ja": "ふむ、インパクトは絶大よね。デコレーションを\nハロウィンのメイク風にしたりもできるし……。", "zh": "嗯，冲击力确实很强。还可以把装饰做成万圣节妆容的风格……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1039_048rei", "source_sha256": "420bf79a8c0d0bacff6374d4146c5f83f065aec3a7fa72c8803c64862ba02b77", "ja": "じゃあ決定ですね！　やった～！\nギュムム～って型取るの、楽しみだな～。", "zh": "那就这么决定了！太好了～！\n期待着咕呜呜～地取模呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1040_048rei", "source_sha256": "489e506a32cdc8bdfdd90122a0ccd40b35506bdd7e7e73f60a18748c6c443478", "ja": "型取りって、息は何分くらい止めたらいいんでしょう？\n5分くらい？　それとも10分かな？", "zh": "翻模的时候，要憋气几分钟才行呢？\n5分钟左右？还是10分钟呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1041_023aka", "source_sha256": "091ef308100b38f5c16d1c07317bfda07774b089539faf9fcdf03d024f8b313a", "ja": "そ、そんなにがんばったら茜ちゃん、\n息の根まで止まっちゃわない！？", "zh": "要是这么拼命的话，小茜，岂不是连呼吸都要停了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1042_tantousya", "source_sha256": "86f565dd527c3f01e724d26130435fe2504ddfc5226f29d85bffc2e2b89e6330", "ja": "アイドルの皆さんが協力的で、ありがたい限りです！\nおふたりの意欲に、全力でお応えしてみせますね！", "zh": "偶像们都很配合，真是感激不尽！\n我一定会全力回应两位的热情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1043_048rei", "source_sha256": "ebf68a0aa36996346534bf7c1aff0ea9d2963c8d62f967a157aefb0b2393a16d", "ja": "わあ、ありがとうございます♪\n茜ちゃん、顔型取るの、がんばろうね！", "zh": "哇，太感谢了♪\n小茜，做脸部倒模要加油哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1044_023aka", "source_sha256": "95dfe6a82ef789a44638c2033268d89e1d48db219938f64402cc021e703336a2", "ja": "ま、待って麗花ちゃん！　茜ちゃん今日はちょっと、\nお肌の調子が……ギニャ～～！！？", "zh": "等、等等丽花！　小茜今天稍微有点，\n皮肤状态不太……哇啊啊～～！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_02_1045_p", "source_sha256": "32ec7f028663eb21f1de9b01f2316d0eccee553da0d9adacab1cbf7e1a5ebc64", "ja": "（茜はもちろん、麗花の発想力も流石だな。\n想像以上に、ユニークなイベントになりそうだ！）", "zh": "（茜当然不用说，就连丽花的想象力也真是厉害。看来会变成一场超乎想象的独特活动呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
